// per-output-channel weight tiles through a single shared-memory buffer;
// chunk k+1 is issued right after chunk k has been fully consumed and the
// prologue load overlaps the input-tile staging. Falls back to plain
// copies when 16B alignment is not guaranteed or when the architecture
// does not support asynchronous copies.
